hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"219","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Saat aasmanon aur chhae hue ke Rab, saat zameenon aur uthae hue ke Rab, shaitanon aur gumrah kiye ke Rab, hawaon aur udae hue ke Rab! Is basti ki bhalai, is ke bashindon ki bhalai aur is mein jo bhalai mangta hun; is ke shar, is ke bashindon ke shar aur is mein jo shar us se teri panah chahta hun. [Basti mein dakhil hokar padhe]"
